N ereplace.pkg
D 17 Jul 2026
U 8
d 'EREPLACE': module to extend egen and egenmore to permit replacing
d 
d    ereplace extends the popular egen and egenmore (if installed)
d modules to permit replacing. ereplace replaces varname of the
d optionally specified storage type [type] equal to
d fcn(arguments).  Depending on fcn(), arguments refers to an
d expression, a varlist, a numlist, or an empty    string. The
d options are similarly function dependent.
d 
d KW: data management
d KW: egen
d KW: replace
d 
d Requires: Stata version 6
d 
d Distribution-Date: 20200511
d 
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d 
d Author: Chris Larkin, The Behavioural Insights Team
d Support: email chris.larkin@@bi.team
d 
f e\ereplace.ado
f e\ereplace.sthlp
e
